  user_input {
    user_response: "You are an expert Principal AI Software Architect, Lead UI/UX Designer, and Full-Stack Developer creating a world-class, production-ready web application in Firebase Studio for an AI startup named \"TruthScan AI\".\n\n# PROJECT OVERVIEW: TruthScan AI\nTruthScan AI is an investor-grade, $50M-style AI startup launched in 2026 that provides computer-vision-powered authenticity verification for cosmetics, skincare, and luxury retail products.\n\n---\n\n# 1. CORE TECH STACK & ARCHITECTURE\n- Framework: Next.js 14+ (App Router, React 18, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS)\n- Backend & Storage: Firebase Backend Ecosystem\n  - Firebase Authentication (Google, Email/Password, Anonymous)\n  - Firestore Database (Scan records, User profiles, Verification logs)\n  - Firebase Cloud Storage (Uploaded product images for AI vision processing)\n  - Firebase Cloud Functions (Triggers for AI processing & webhook sync)\n  - Firebase Hosting (Global CDN)\n- Motion & Graphics:\n  - Framer Motion & GSAP (Scroll-driven reveals, hover physics, layout transitions)\n  - Lenis Smooth Scroll (Seamless momentum scrolling)\n  - Three.js / React Three Fiber (R3F) (Interactive 3D canvas, glowing neural nodes, holographic cubes)\n  - Lucide React (Clean, minimalist iconography)\n- Styling Engine: Tailwind CSS + CSS Custom Variables for Liquid Glass, Mesh Gradients, Aurora Effects, Holographic Borders.\n\n---\n\n# 2. DESIGN SYSTEM & VISUAL LANGUAGE (2026 AI AESTHETIC)\n- Theme: Ultra-futuristic, high-contrast Dark & Light dynamic glass, Apple-meets-NVIDIA aesthetic.\n- Color Palette:\n  - Background: Deep Void Navy `#030712`, Obsidian `#0B0F19`, Pure White `#FFFFFF`\n  - Neon Accents: Cyan `#06B6D4`, Electric Violet `#8B5CF6`, AI Blue `#3B82F6`, Emerald Verify `#10B981`\n  - Glass Surface: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03)` with `backdrop-filter: blur(16px)` and `1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)`.\n- Typography: Inter / Plus Jakarta Sans / Space Grotesk hierarchy.\n\n---\n\n# 3. PAGE STRUCTURE & COMPONENT SYSTEM\n\nGenerate a multi-section single page application (SPA) with routing for dynamic reports:\n\n## A. Navigation Bar (Floating Glass Island)\n- Interactive glowing logo mark (`TruthScan AI`)\n- Dynamic navigation links (Features, Live Demo, How It Works, Architecture, Roadmap)\n- Interactive Action: \"Join Waitlist\" (Modal trigger) and \"Launch Live Scan\" (Scroll focus)\n\n## B. Hero Section (Cinematic & Interactive)\n- Headline: \"Scan. Verify. Trust.\"\n- Subheadline: \"AI-powered real-time authenticity verification for skincare, beauty, and luxury products.\"\n- Interactive R3F 3D Canvas: Glowing, rotatable AI Core sphere reacting to cursor movement.\n- Live Interactive Scan Simulation:\n  - Floating Glass Card showing an animated product bottle (Skincare/Serum) being scanned by a moving laser grid line.\n  - Live AI vision bounding boxes highlighting \"Logo\", \"Batch Code #8F2026\", \"Barcode\", and \"OCR Text\".\n  - Dynamic Authenticity Score counter ramping up from 0% to **99.8% Genuine**.\n- Primary CTA buttons: \"Try Live Demo\" and \"Watch Vision Architecture\".\n\n## C. Interactive Live Demo Engine (Firebase Storage + AI Simulation)\nBuild a functional client-side scanner interface connected to Firebase:\n1. Drag-and-Drop / Camera Capture: Users can upload a product image (or pick from 3 pre-loaded samples: Genuine Serum, Counterfeit Lip Gloss, Flagged Perfume).\n2. Processing Phase: \n   - Multi-step loading state with visual logs (\"Extracting OCR...\", \"Checking Molecular Print...\", \"Verifying Barcode against Global Ledger...\").\n3. Verification Result Dashboard:\n   - Authenticity Score Radial Gauge (Dynamic color: Green > 90%, Yellow > 70%, Red < 70%).\n   - Bounding Box Visualizer overlay on the uploaded image.\n   - Fraud Risk Heatmap breakdown (Logo placement, Typography kerning, Packaging material reflectivity).\n   - Firebase Firestore Action: Auto-save scan report to user\'s history and generate a shareable link.\n\n## D. Interactive Vision Architecture (Node System)\n- Interactive flow diagram illustrating the AI pipeline:\n  `Camera Capture` \342\236\224 `Computer Vision Mesh` \342\236\224 `OCR Engine` \342\236\224 `Packaging Reflectivity Model` \342\236\224 `Global Anti-Counterfeit Ledger` \342\236\224 `Explainable AI Report`\n- Clicking any node opens a glass drawer detailing model parameters (e.g., \"YOLOv8 fine-tuned on 10M+ luxury packaging items\").\n\n## E. \"Why TruthScan AI\" (Interactive Feature Matrix)\n- Side-by-side liquid-glass comparison cards:\n  - Traditional Verification (Slow, Manual, 64% accuracy, spot checks)\n  - TruthScan AI (Instant 0.4s scan, 99.8% precision, micro-texture detection, explainable report).\n\n## F. Interactive Roadmap & Enterprise Features\n- Vertical animated timeline with phase milestones (Q1 2026 to Q4 2027) featuring glass hover states and status pills (\"Live\", \"In Testing\", \"Upcoming\").\n\n## G. Firebase-Powered Lead Generation & Waitlist Modal\n- High-converting glass modal form capturing: Name, Email, Organization Type (Brand, Retailer, Consumer), and Volume.\n- Connect direct write access to Firestore collection `waitlist_leads`.\n- Add success toast with instant confetti and unique Queue Number display.\n\n---\n\n# 4. FIRESTORE SCHEMA & FIREBASE CONFIGURATION\n\nEnsure the generated code includes a `firebase.ts` modular initialization setup reading environment variables:\n`NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID`, etc.\n\n### Firestore Collections:\n1. `scans`:\n   - `id`: string\n   - `imageUrl`: string\n   - `authenticityScore`: number (0 - 100)\n   - `status`: \"genuine\" | \"suspicious\" | \"counterfeit\"\n   - `detectedFeatures`: array of objects `{ label: string, confidence: number }`\n   - `createdAt`: timestamp\n2. `waitlist_leads`:\n   - `email`: string\n   - `role`: string\n   - `createdAt`: timestamp\n\n---\n\n# 5. CODE OUTPUT INSTRUCTIONS\n- Produce clean, modern, modular React/TypeScript code using standard components.\n- Include custom inline SVG animations, Tailwind glassmorphism styles, and CSS laser-scan Keyframes.\n- Do NOT use generic placeholder text; write precise, authoritative, enterprise-grade AI technical copy.\n- Implement responsive layout rules for desktop, tablet, and mobile browsers.\n\nBegin generating the complete application structure now."
    items {
      text: "You are an expert Principal AI Software Architect, Lead UI/UX Designer, and Full-Stack Developer creating a world-class, production-ready web application in Firebase Studio for an AI startup named \"TruthScan AI\".\n\n# PROJECT OVERVIEW: TruthScan AI\nTruthScan AI is an investor-grade, $50M-style AI startup launched in 2026 that provides computer-vision-powered authenticity verification for cosmetics, skincare, and luxury retail products.\n\n---\n\n# 1. CORE TECH STACK & ARCHITECTURE\n- Framework: Next.js 14+ (App Router, React 18, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS)\n- Backend & Storage: Firebase Backend Ecosystem\n  - Firebase Authentication (Google, Email/Password, Anonymous)\n  - Firestore Database (Scan records, User profiles, Verification logs)\n  - Firebase Cloud Storage (Uploaded product images for AI vision processing)\n  - Firebase Cloud Functions (Triggers for AI processing & webhook sync)\n  - Firebase Hosting (Global CDN)\n- Motion & Graphics:\n  - Framer Motion & GSAP (Scroll-driven reveals, hover physics, layout transitions)\n  - Lenis Smooth Scroll (Seamless momentum scrolling)\n  - Three.js / React Three Fiber (R3F) (Interactive 3D canvas, glowing neural nodes, holographic cubes)\n  - Lucide React (Clean, minimalist iconography)\n- Styling Engine: Tailwind CSS + CSS Custom Variables for Liquid Glass, Mesh Gradients, Aurora Effects, Holographic Borders.\n\n---\n\n# 2. DESIGN SYSTEM & VISUAL LANGUAGE (2026 AI AESTHETIC)\n- Theme: Ultra-futuristic, high-contrast Dark & Light dynamic glass, Apple-meets-NVIDIA aesthetic.\n- Color Palette:\n  - Background: Deep Void Navy `#030712`, Obsidian `#0B0F19`, Pure White `#FFFFFF`\n  - Neon Accents: Cyan `#06B6D4`, Electric Violet `#8B5CF6`, AI Blue `#3B82F6`, Emerald Verify `#10B981`\n  - Glass Surface: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03)` with `backdrop-filter: blur(16px)` and `1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)`.\n- Typography: Inter / Plus Jakarta Sans / Space Grotesk hierarchy.\n\n---\n\n# 3. PAGE STRUCTURE & COMPONENT SYSTEM\n\nGenerate a multi-section single page application (SPA) with routing for dynamic reports:\n\n## A. Navigation Bar (Floating Glass Island)\n- Interactive glowing logo mark (`TruthScan AI`)\n- Dynamic navigation links (Features, Live Demo, How It Works, Architecture, Roadmap)\n- Interactive Action: \"Join Waitlist\" (Modal trigger) and \"Launch Live Scan\" (Scroll focus)\n\n## B. Hero Section (Cinematic & Interactive)\n- Headline: \"Scan. Verify. Trust.\"\n- Subheadline: \"AI-powered real-time authenticity verification for skincare, beauty, and luxury products.\"\n- Interactive R3F 3D Canvas: Glowing, rotatable AI Core sphere reacting to cursor movement.\n- Live Interactive Scan Simulation:\n  - Floating Glass Card showing an animated product bottle (Skincare/Serum) being scanned by a moving laser grid line.\n  - Live AI vision bounding boxes highlighting \"Logo\", \"Batch Code #8F2026\", \"Barcode\", and \"OCR Text\".\n  - Dynamic Authenticity Score counter ramping up from 0% to **99.8% Genuine**.\n- Primary CTA buttons: \"Try Live Demo\" and \"Watch Vision Architecture\".\n\n## C. Interactive Live Demo Engine (Firebase Storage + AI Simulation)\nBuild a functional client-side scanner interface connected to Firebase:\n1. Drag-and-Drop / Camera Capture: Users can upload a product image (or pick from 3 pre-loaded samples: Genuine Serum, Counterfeit Lip Gloss, Flagged Perfume).\n2. Processing Phase: \n   - Multi-step loading state with visual logs (\"Extracting OCR...\", \"Checking Molecular Print...\", \"Verifying Barcode against Global Ledger...\").\n3. Verification Result Dashboard:\n   - Authenticity Score Radial Gauge (Dynamic color: Green > 90%, Yellow > 70%, Red < 70%).\n   - Bounding Box Visualizer overlay on the uploaded image.\n   - Fraud Risk Heatmap breakdown (Logo placement, Typography kerning, Packaging material reflectivity).\n   - Firebase Firestore Action: Auto-save scan report to user\'s history and generate a shareable link.\n\n## D. Interactive Vision Architecture (Node System)\n- Interactive flow diagram illustrating the AI pipeline:\n  `Camera Capture` \342\236\224 `Computer Vision Mesh` \342\236\224 `OCR Engine` \342\236\224 `Packaging Reflectivity Model` \342\236\224 `Global Anti-Counterfeit Ledger` \342\236\224 `Explainable AI Report`\n- Clicking any node opens a glass drawer detailing model parameters (e.g., \"YOLOv8 fine-tuned on 10M+ luxury packaging items\").\n\n## E. \"Why TruthScan AI\" (Interactive Feature Matrix)\n- Side-by-side liquid-glass comparison cards:\n  - Traditional Verification (Slow, Manual, 64% accuracy, spot checks)\n  - TruthScan AI (Instant 0.4s scan, 99.8% precision, micro-texture detection, explainable report).\n\n## F. Interactive Roadmap & Enterprise Features\n- Vertical animated timeline with phase milestones (Q1 2026 to Q4 2027) featuring glass hover states and status pills (\"Live\", \"In Testing\", \"Upcoming\").\n\n## G. Firebase-Powered Lead Generation & Waitlist Modal\n- High-converting glass modal form capturing: Name, Email, Organization Type (Brand, Retailer, Consumer), and Volume.\n- Connect direct write access to Firestore collection `waitlist_leads`.\n- Add success toast with instant confetti and unique Queue Number display.\n\n---\n\n# 4. FIRESTORE SCHEMA & FIREBASE CONFIGURATION\n\nEnsure the generated code includes a `firebase.ts` modular initialization setup reading environment variables:\n`NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID`, etc.\n\n### Firestore Collections:\n1. `scans`:\n   - `id`: string\n   - `imageUrl`: string\n   - `authenticityScore`: number (0 - 100)\n   - `status`: \"genuine\" | \"suspicious\" | \"counterfeit\"\n   - `detectedFeatures`: array of objects `{ label: string, confidence: number }`\n   - `createdAt`: timestamp\n2. `waitlist_leads`:\n   - `email`: string\n   - `role`: string\n   - `createdAt`: timestamp\n\n---\n\n# 5. CODE OUTPUT INSTRUCTIONS\n- Produce clean, modern, modular React/TypeScript code using standard components.\n- Include custom inline SVG animations, Tailwind glassmorphism styles, and CSS laser-scan Keyframes.\n- Do NOT use generic placeholder text; write precise, authoritative, enterprise-grade AI technical copy.\n- Implement responsive layout rules for desktop, tablet, and mobile browsers.\n\nBegin generating the complete application structure now."
