  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Celebrating a Clean Build**\n\nI\'m thrilled! The build executed flawlessly; no errors, no warnings! I\'m now taking a step back to re-evaluate the initial instructions and goals, to ensure I\'m on track and haven\'t missed a crucial detail in the process. I\'m focusing on the next steps, particularly summarizing the outcome of this stage and ensuring everything is aligned.\n\n\n**Refining Functional Overview**\n\nI\'m now crafting the final design and functional summary, as requested. I\'ve focused on clarity, avoiding jargon, and highlighting the user-facing features. This is a crucial step to ensuring the project\'s overall understanding. I\'m prioritizing a clear conceptual description of the implemented modules, especially the navigation bar and hero section. I\'ve been intentionally omitting internal details, and just focusing on the design and function.\n\n\n**Finalizing UI Features**\n\nI\'ve just finalized the detailed UI for the interactive demo engine, it is connected to Firestore. Users can drag and drop images or select from pre-loaded presets. I\'ve focused on custom metrics, scan logs, a score gauge, and bounding box overlays. The fraud risk breakdown and historical scanned ledger lists are also real-time, synced with Firestore. I\'ve finished the vision architecture flow diagram, showing the deep learning pipeline, and \"Why TruthScan AI\" comparisons. The roadmap is an interactive vertical timeline.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the development and verification of **TruthScan AI**, an ultra-polished, investor-grade computer vision authenticity platform for luxury cosmetics, skincare, and retail packaging. \n\nFollowing a high-contrast **2026 AI Aesthetic**, the application pairs high-performance HTML5 canvas math with a secure, real-time Firebase Firestore data layer to simulate and save industrial-grade packaging evaluations.\n\n### \360\237\214\237 Design & Aesthetic Overview\n- **Visual Identity**: Tailored in deep void hues, pure obsidian surfaces, and luminous cyberpunk highlights (Cyan, Electric Violet, and Emerald Verify).\n- **Holographic Core Physics**: Integrated an interactive 3D particle neural sphere that reacts to cursor drag-and-hover coordinates, complemented by secondary rotating target indicators.\n- **Micro-animations**: Styled custom keyframe-animated **Laser Grids** that trace scanning bounds, responsive bounding boxes that pulse with prediction metrics, and liquid-glass transitions.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Core Functional Modules\n\n*   **Floating Glass Navigation Island**\n    *   A persistent, elegant glass-morphic floating header with active scroll anchoring to Features, Live Demo, Pipeline, and Roadmap.\n    *   Provides instant action triggers to launch scanning controls or access the priority waitlist gateway.\n\n*   **Cinematic Laser-Scan Hero**\n    *   Showcases the *\"Scan. Verify. Trust.\"* brand identity paired with an active, real-time counter that ramps up from 0% to **99.8% Genuine**.\n    *   Integrates a dual-axis blueprint simulation outlining spatial bounding boxes (*Logo Match*, *Batch #8F2026*) under active optical analysis.\n\n*   **Interactive Live Demo Scanner Engine**\n    *   **Dynamic Inputs**: Allows immediate image upload or selection from three high-fidelity luxury presets: *Genuine Serum* (99.8% score), *Counterfeit Gloss* (14.3% score), and *Suspicious Perfume* (68.5% score).\n    *   **Neural Activity Console**: Streams custom progressive console diagnostics as the model evaluates package reflectivity, label kerning, and batch ledgers.\n    *   **Parametric Result Dashboard**: Displays an active radial gauge, dynamic trust breakdown, and barcode registries verified in real-time.\n    *   **Cryptographic Ledger History**: Reads and writes scan results securely to the Firestore database, allowing users to scroll historical audits or generate a cryptographic shareable report link.\n\n*   **Neural Pipeline Node Flow**\n    *   Features an interactive flow diagram mapping the deep learning lifecycle from *Camera Capture* through *Computer Vision Polygon Mesh*, *Sub-pixel OCR*, and *Refractive Material NeRF Shader*.\n    *   Clicking nodes dynamically transitions an informative terminal drawer detailing precise parameter weights, gRPC microservice latency, and framework backbones.\n\n*   **Competitive Metric Comparison**\n    *   An objective, side-by-side matrix contrasting slow, manual old-world laboratory audits with TruthScan\'s instant sub-second deep learning neural arrays.\n\n*   **Milestone Timeline**\n    *   A clean vertical timeline tracking development milestones from Q1 2026 through Q4 2027, accented by custom status pills (*Live*, *In Testing*, *Upcoming*) and sub-feature checkmarks.\n\n*   **Firestore Lead Capture Gateway**\n    *   A high-converting, secure popup form capturing name, email, organization role, and monthly volume.\n    *   Upon successful Firestore record validation, the modal queries active database entries to calculate a unique **Priority Queue Position**, triggering a brilliant cascade of custom celebration confetti.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 472884814
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
